ough the free SEC EDGAR API."],"features":["At a glance, then tabs. Results open with six one-line verdicts (revenue, earnings, dividend, red flags, SEC record, value checklists). The detail sits in tabs: Overview, Red flags, SEC history, Insiders, Graham &…","Smart search: type a company name or a ticker. Up to 8 suggestions appear as you type (an accessible combobox: arrow keys, Enter, Escape), ranked exact ticker, well-known brand name (e.g. Google → GOOGL, Facebook →…","Quote of the day on the start page: one a day from 47 quotes, 31 by Warren Buffett (each checked word for word against his shareholder letter of that year) and 16 by Peter Lynch, Charlie Munger, John Bogle and JL…","10-year trends for revenue, net income, EPS, and dividend per share, with CAGR and a trend label (growing, flat, declining, volatile). For companies that report R&D, a further tile shows R&D as a share of revenue on the…","Latest 12 months from the newest quarterly report (10-Q): revenue, net income, EPS and free cash flow for the trailing twelve months (last fiscal year + this year's quarters − the same quarters a year earlier), set…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dipak-nehe/stock-trend-analyzer/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"4436131723702d2d9ad61e261ce075270c9ba19ee3bc59aa233701b102f09caa","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T07:59:38.966Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T07:59:38.966Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Live site: stock-value-analysis.vercel.app · try AAPL, KO, SMCI","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/dipak-nehe/stock-trend-analyzer/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"not_required","text":"The list (up to 30 stocks) is saved in the browser, with no account needed, and My portfolio always shows that saved list: it re-reads it when you come Back to the page or another tab saves to it, and its address never carries the list (an old address can't bring back an out-of-date one).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/di